    "title": "Gun Sounds: Tough Guns",
    "description": "Have you always dreamed of being a character in action movies and being able to shoot from different amazing <b>guns</b> and <b>lightsaber</b>? Download this super fun <b>gun simulator with the most realistic gun sounds</b> which will blow your mind and sweep you off your feet. <b>Tough guns</b> included in this <b>simulador de pistolas</b> are among the best you can find. This game has a lot to offer, such as amusing <b>sounds of tough guns and pistolas </b>. You will for sure enjoy <b>Gun Sound Simulator: Tough Guns</b> - your new <b>juegos de pistolas e simulador de arma de fuego</b> and become the best shooter with powerful <b>weaponry</b> and <b>lightsaber</b>. The realistic <b>tough guns will make everyone who plays this gun app</b> beyond amazed. The list of the <b>weapons and guns</b> you can find in this amazing gun app is long. Some of the weapons available in one of the most popular <b>gun simulator</b> are: <b>Pistol, M16, AK-47, <b>lightsaber</b>, Sniper, Grenade, Vulcan, RPG, Flamethrower, Keltec shotgun, Grenade</b> and many others. All of these great <b>weapons</b> are divided into three groups: <b>pistols, rifles and tough guns</b>. All the weapons are realistic. If you want to pretend you are shooting at a target or you just want to pass the time, here are the perfect <b>guns</b> for you. One of the many <b>tough guns available in Gun Simulator-Siimulador de Arma de Fuego</b> is RPG or the Rocket-Propelled Grenade. It is a shoulder-fired missile weapon which launches rockets equipped with an explosive warhead. They are mostly used as anti-tank weapons. \ud83d\udca5 Features of <b>Gun Simulator: Gun Sounds - Tough guns</b>\ud83d\udca5 \u2705A collection of <b>guns and pistolas</b> and around 50 amazing weapons are at your disposal \u2705Ammunition without limit and unlimited shooting with the best guns and pistolas you will find \u2705Vibration and camera flash which add up to the feeling like firing from a real <b>gun</b> \u2705Graphics of high resolution that will delight you and immerse you into the world of guns \u2705Mirror effect for a better experience of shooting \u2705Weapon sounds which are like the real sounds produced by real <b>guns and pistols</b>, and effects that match these great <b>guns, pistolas and other weapons</b>. Gun sound effects that are included are loud, machine gun, single, burst shots, automatic, shake. \u2705Easy gameplay. You just need to shake the phone to fire the <b>guns and other weapons and shoot a gun simulator</b>, that is all. Each user of the gun app can adjust the camera flash while shooting, whether it will be on or off. Vibration can be included or not, it depends on the user\u2019s wish, and can be turned on or off anytime. Unlimited ammo and mirror mode can both be adjusted as well. Set everything the way you like it and you are ready to try out the weapons and shoot! Whether you are a pro or a beginner it is completely irrelevant. With this incredible <b>gun game</b> the fun is guaranteed. Easy to use, this <b>gun sound simulator</b> will make you feel like you are holding a real <b>pistols</b> in your hand because <b>gun sounds</b> are very realistic and genuine. The positive thing is that, although it is a game that contains weapons, there is not the slightest chance you will get hurt. If you are one of those who greatly enjoys <b>pistolas, guns and juegos de pistolas</b> , this app is made for you! Wait no more, grab your phone and get this <b>super cool gun simulator, which is also e juegos de pistolas</b>. You will surely never regret it. Download <b>Gun Simulator: Gun Sounds</b> and have fun with around 50 unique virtual guns, pistols, RPG including the <b>lightsaber</b>and realistic gun sounds!",
